- rgw/datalog: enable fallback implementation of asio co_compose
- rgw : Fixing Priority levels of the perfCounters ( rhbz#2411930)
- rgw/dedup: Prevent the dup-counter from wrapping around after it reaches 64K of identical copies. ( rhbz#2415656)
